                        "entry_id": "65746665-fc9c-3ae5-8475-451302dca865",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fabriquant français de matériel d'éclairage et d'ampoules électriques."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Marque commerciale"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e5564276-3d09-3864-ab30-a8b386b9e128",
                        "entry_id": "65746665-fc9c-3ae5-8475-451302dca865",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Constructeur automobile japonais."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Marque commerciale"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2f55367-42f7-428f-825a-f7becd0670a8",
                                "sense_id": "e5564276-3d09-3864-ab30-a8b386b9e128",
                                "text": "La famille Wallenberg, propriétaire de Saab et l’une des principales dynasties financières suédoises, échoua dans ses négociations avec Mazda et Fiat, mais fit finalement affaire avec General Motors à la fin de l’année 1989."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eebc0445-c8fc-4e51-9441-886f5246fc29",
                        "source_entry_id": "65746665-fc9c-3ae5-8475-451302dca865",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mazda",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mazda",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eb1c603-18b2-303e-b90d-e9e3e26c1db7",
                                        "entry_id": "32b06ee0-63eb-377f-83da-3dd96851c1de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ahura Mazda, the supreme and transcendental god of Zoroastrianism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mazda",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d354b25-0cbb-3859-a6ae-8314b52de05e",
                                        "entry_id": "1c92a7dc-143b-35de-9c5d-fa096333bee9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A vehicle, especially a car, manufactured by the Mazda Motor Corporation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d059ee9b-f19a-4b20-9c14-6a01daab30cb",
                                                "sense_id": "2d354b25-0cbb-3859-a6ae-8314b52de05e",
                                                "text": "Nicole and I met outside the church after my bell choir rehersal. I will never forget watching her climb out of her Mazda RX7 and just keep going up, up, up. She was tall, she was blond and she was gorgeous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b33b698-19ca-497f-8183-a18e646b59dc",
                                                "sense_id": "2d354b25-0cbb-3859-a6ae-8314b52de05e",
                                                "text": "one of Skip’s friends from the fire department agreed to drive the U-haul with his girlfriend, pulling our Mazda behind, as we drove in the Bronco. I will never forget seeing our cats’ faces in the Mazda while we were following behind."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3aba5ad0-5424-4dff-a760-0f91f362c2fd",
                                                "sense_id": "2d354b25-0cbb-3859-a6ae-8314b52de05e",
                                                "text": "...seated atop a genuine (detached) commode of the white porcelain variety, which he had lugged at great hernia-inducing peril from the back of his Mazda to the Outdoor Cinema site, several blocks away."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d37149a7-d41d-47ed-825f-661660a3dfe3",
                        "source_entry_id": "65746665-fc9c-3ae5-8475-451302dca865",
